      "versionNonce": 1972595471,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793051056200,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Applicatie\nFHIR-client",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "yZHtwZZ5PVWAVvN02XFvX",
      "originalText": "Applicatie\nFHIR-client",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "iGbjeYacwKJPeMyV1JDsg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 425,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 890,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "1793051050232-eizwtkziy",
      "index": "a8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 255603201,
      "version": 8,
      "versionNonce": 1878511969,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793051056200,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "a) Autorisatiemodel: OpenID Connect\n/authorize: burger logt in (DigiD, GIDS private ID), geeft toestemming\nkortdurend (access_token) of langlopend (refresh_token, offline_access)\naccess_token met SMART on FHIR-scopes; de FHIR API dwingt af",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Mu0EWtONYZqr4hfx-fQIo",
      "originalText": "a) Autorisatiemodel: OpenID Connect\n/authorize: burger logt in (DigiD, GIDS private ID), geeft toestemming\nkortdurend (access_token) of langlopend (refresh_token, offline_access)\naccess_token met SMART on FHIR-scopes; de FHIR API dwingt af",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8-DuQkufSCrITm6sHNNC6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 425,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 890,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2b8a3e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "1793051050232-eizwtkziy",
      "index": "a9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 130566625,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 154218799,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793051056200,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "b) FHIR API volgens de WellData IG (externe interface)\nmaakt gegevens beschikbaar volgens de FAIR-principes:\nprofielen, zoeken, validatie, transacties,\nmetadata, versies en audit trail (NEN 7513)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sodFAWTkKEFFMXM-GM-_F",
      "originalText": "b) FHIR API volgens de WellData IG (externe interface)\nmaakt gegevens beschikbaar volgens de FAIR-principes:\nprofielen, zoeken, validatie, transacties,\nmetadata, versies en audit trail (NEN 7513)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-uvStnGUqsdAFFITFgbHM",
